Unfortunately, I can't create a binary image file directly. 

I'd recommend creating a new icon for the "Browser Tab to Markdown" command to differentiate it from the regular "Webpage to Markdown" command. You could:

1. Use the Raycast Icon Maker (https://icon.ray.so/) to create a custom icon
2. Use a browser tab icon with a markdown symbol
3. Save it as "browser-tab-icon.png" in the assets folder

Then update the package.json to include the icon in the command definition:

```json
{
  "name": "browser-tab-to-markdown",
  "title": "Browser Tab to Markdown",
  "subtitle": "Convert current browser tab to markdown format",
  "description": "Gets the current browser tab URL and converts it to markdown using Jina AI",
  "mode": "view",
  "icon": "browser-tab-icon.png"
}
``` 